From 4fea05201275b12ea890f9077c52bcf89c45c2fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: diamondStar35 <ramymaherali55@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:34:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add sample-clocked PCM output fades

Add audio-fade commands and state for an envelope independent of volume and mute. Ramp per sample frame with aligned channel gains and full-precision multiplication. Track audible completion, suspend deadlines during pause, and reset discarded output state.
---
